# AI documentation rules

Keep documentation factual and concise.

Update when relevant:
- `PROJECT.md`: stable project facts.
- `DOMAIN.md`: business concepts and vocabulary.
- `ARCHITECTURE.md`: current architecture.
- `CURRENT_STATE.md`: baseline snapshot.
- `CONSTRAINTS.md`: hard limitations.
- `TECH_DEBT.md`: known debt and priorities.
- `DECISIONS.md`: meaningful architectural decisions.
- `AI_CHANGELOG.md`: significant AI-assisted changes.
- `ROADMAP.md`: planned improvement sequence.

Do not rewrite project history to make the current architecture look intentional.
